    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Ardeal is a real-time strategy game where you manage your citizens, develop a robust economy, and command your armies in strategic battles.<strong><br> <br>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RTS Action:</strong> Build up your town, gather resources, and lead your armies to victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Builder Mechanics: </strong>Manage your settlement with care. Ensure your citizens\u2019 needs are met to prevent unrest, avoid desertions, and fend off brigand raids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Ages:</strong> Advance from swords and bows to rifles and cannons, unlocking new units, innovative structures, and new strategies as your civilization evolves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Challenge other players or team up with friends through seamless Steam online functionality!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Time Combat:</strong>\u00a0Deploy cavalry to outflank foes while your infantry holds the line, or position your archers behind fortifications to rain arrows on the enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; Coop Missions:</strong>\u00a0Engage in historical scenarios to test your skills, alone or together with friends!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Ardeal is a real-time strategy game where you manage your citizens, develop a robust economy, and command your armies in strategic battles.<strong><br> <br>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RTS Action:</strong> Build up your town, gather resources, and lead your armies to victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Builder Mechanics: </strong>Manage your settlement with care. Ensure your citizens\u2019 needs are met to prevent unrest, avoid desertions, and fend off brigand raids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Ages:</strong> Advance from swords and bows to rifles and cannons, unlocking new units, innovative structures, and new strategies as your civilization evolves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Challenge other players or team up with friends through seamless Steam online functionality!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Time Combat:</strong>\u00a0Deploy cavalry to outflank foes while your infantry holds the line, or position your archers behind fortifications to rain arrows on the enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; Coop Missions:</strong>\u00a0Engage in historical scenarios to test your skills, alone or together with friends!</p></li></ul>",
